  $7342,$02 Jump to #R$734B to print a newline without the stop.
N $7344 Reached through the control-code table at #R$7295, dispatched by #R$72DD.
  $7344,$02 Class #N$30 prints a stop and a newline.
  $7346,$02 Jump to #R$734B to print the stop and a newline.

