@ $735B label=PrintMessage_TokenByNibble_Return
N $735B Reached through the control-code table at #R$7295, dispatched by #R$72DD.
  $735B,$04 Bring #REGde back from #R$70DD.
  $735F,$04 Bring #REGix back from #R$70E0.
  $7363,$03 Bring back the #REGa saved at #R$70DC.
