  $736B,$03 Drop the dispatcher return and restore the caller's object pointer from the stack into #REGhl.
  $736E,$06 Put the dispatcher return back, and call #R$7434 if the object pointer is not zero.
  $7374,$01 Finish this control code with zero.
  $7375,$01 Return.

