b $C730 Action Table
@ $C730 label=ActionTable
D $C730 Read by #R$94D6 and #R$950F.
N $C730 Action: "#ACTION".
B $C730,$01 Action ID.
W $C731,$02 Action routine.
L $C730,$03,$1F
N $C78D End of table.
B $C78D,$01 #TERMINATOR

b $C78E Event Jump Table
D $C78E Read by #R$8D9D.
N $C78E #LOCATION(#PEEK(#PC)) - "#LOCATIONNAME(#PEEK(#PC))".
B $C78E,$01 Location ID.
W $C78F,$02 Event address.
L $C78E,$03,$07
N $C7A3 End of table.
B $C7A3,$01 #TERMINATOR

c $C7A4 Event: #LOCATIONNAME($16)
@ $C7A4 label=EventBeornsHouse
D $C7A4 Runs this place's special event when a character's script reaches
. it.
. Reached through the event table at #R$C78E, dispatched by #R$8D9D.
N $C7A4 At the start of the game, the #TEXTTOKEN($C430 + $08, $01) is invisible (!) and only becomes visible after
. entering #LOCATIONNAME($16).
  $C7A4,$03 Point #REGhl at the attributes of #OBJECT($42,$01,$01)($).
  $C7A7,$03 Return if the "#TEXTTOKEN($C430 + $08, $01)" is "broken" (bit 3 is set).
  $C7AA,$05 Write #N$42 to #R$CAE7.
  $C7AF,$02 Set "visible" bit for "#TEXTTOKEN($C430 + $08, $01)".
  $C7B1,$01 Return.

c $C7B2 Event: #LOCATIONNAME($1A)
@ $C7B2 label=EventSpiderThreadsPlace
D $C7B2 Runs this place's special event when a character's script reaches
. it.
. Reached through the event table at #R$C78E, dispatched by #R$8D9D.
  $C7B2,$06 Copy #R$CA92 to #R$CA93.
  $C7B8,$01 Return.

c $C7B9 Event: #LOCATIONNAME($1D)
@ $C7B9 label=EventDeepBog
D $C7B9 Runs this place's special event when a character's script reaches
. it.
. Reached through the event table at #R$C78E, dispatched by #R$8D9D.
  $C7B9,$06 Copy #R$CAA0 to #R$CAA1.
  $C7BF,$01 Return.

c $C7C0 Event: #LOCATIONNAME($20)
@ $C7C0 label=EventElvenkingsCellar
D $C7C0 Runs this place's special event when a character's script reaches
. it.
. Reached through the event table at #R$C78E, dispatched by #R$8D9D.
  $C7C0,$05 Write #N$03 to #R$CAC4.
  $C7C5,$03 Point #REGhl at the attributes of #OBJECT($3C,$01,$01)($).
  $C7C8,$04 Jump to #R$C7D1 if "#TEXTTOKEN($C133 + $08, $01)" is "broken" (bit 3 is set).
  $C7CC,$05 Write #N$3C to #R$CB03.
@ $C7D1 label=EventElvenkingsCellar_Skip
  $C7D1,$03 Point #REGhl at the attributes of #OBJECT($46,$01,$01)($).
  $C7D4,$03 Return if the "#TEXTTOKEN($C4C3 + $08, $01)" is "broken" (bit 3 is set).
  $C7D7,$05 Write #N$46 to #R$CAFC.
  $C7DC,$01 Return.

c $C7DD Event: #LOCATIONNAME($03)
@ $C7DD label=EventForest
D $C7DD Runs this place's special event when a character's script reaches
. it.
. Reached through the event table at #R$C78E, dispatched by #R$8D9D.
  $C7DD,$06 Copy #R$8D9B to #R$B6F3.
  $C7E3,$06 Copy #R$CABC to #R$CABD.
  $C7E9,$01 Return.

c $C7EA Event: #LOCATIONNAME($21)
@ $C7EA label=EventForestriver
D $C7EA Runs this place's special event when a character's script reaches
. it.
. Reached through the event table at #R$C78E, dispatched by #R$8D9D.
N $C7EA Is Player Protected in "#TEXTTOKEN($C3EE + $08, $01)"
  $C7EA,$06 Return if the player's mother object is #OBJECT($13,$01,$01)($).
N $C7F0 Uh oh... you dead.
  $C7F0,$03 Call #R$8E39 to score this location when it is light.
  $C7F3,$03 Point at the message "You are swept forcefully against the portcullis" (#R$B26D).
  $C7F6,$03 Call #R$72DD to print message.
  $C7F9,$03 Jump back to #R$90D2 to end the game.

