  $C8DE,$01
  $C8DF,$01 #ACTION
  $C8E0,$01 Script code #N$0F: pick a random script entry (#R$9A59).
  $C8E1,$01 From the first #N$04.

b $C8E2 Character Scripts: Thorin?
D $C8E2 A list of script ids and handler addresses, ending at #N($FF), then the script bytes. An #ACTION byte is a verb from #R$AB53.
